      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Solution 4: Confidentiality can't be harmed by an intruder."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Solution 1: By changing the names and emails of one or more users stored in a database."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Solution 1: By exploiting bugs in the systems software to bypass authentication mechanisms for databases."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Solution 2: The systems security is compromised even if only one goal is harmed."
